#: ../../changelog/viewer/index.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV Viewer Changelog"
msgstr "Changelog OpenMV Viewer"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenMV Viewer is the read-only companion to OpenMV IDE, built for showing "
"off a finished product rather than developing one. Here's what's new in each"
" release — feature changes, fixes, and platform support. Releases are "
"grouped by major version, newest first. Click a version to expand its "
"releases."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV Viewer adalah pendamping hanya-baca untuk OpenMV IDE, dibuat untuk "
"memamerkan produk yang sudah selesai alih-alih mengembangkannya. Berikut "
"yang baru di setiap rilis — perubahan fitur, perbaikan, dan dukungan "
"platform. Rilis dikelompokkan menurut versi mayor, terbaru dahulu. Klik "
"sebuah versi untuk memperluas rilisnya."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"OpenMV Viewer shares its codebase and Qt Creator base with :doc:`OpenMV IDE "
"<../ide/index>`; each release notes the Qt Creator base version it was built"
" from. Only OpenMV's own changes are documented here."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV Viewer berbagi basis kode dan basis Qt Creator dengan :doc:`OpenMV "
"IDE <../ide/index>`; setiap rilis mencatat versi basis Qt Creator tempat "
"rilis itu dibangun. Hanya perubahan milik OpenMV sendiri yang "
"didokumentasikan di sini."

